# (AI-assisted) j2strip: Vin's room, then the strip mine (strip-start loads vinroom + strip: the
# pair that left 128 KB of linear memory and 79 parts out). Shots on arrival and 10 s later;
# [ctr] memory lines every 15 s.
1000 continue vinroom-start
1001 -
1002 wait *target* target-stance
1003 log stop: vinroom-start
1004 pos *target*
1300 continue strip-start
1301 -
1302 wait *target* target-stance
1303 log stop: strip-start
1304 pos *target*
1400 shot shot_strip_start
1700 shot shot_strip_later
1701 pos *target*
1702 log stop: end
1900 exit
